        "@value": "the ford theatre    featuring Jillian Meyers, josette wiggan, and more!   Featuring collaborative world premieres and Michelle Dorrance’s own award-winning choreography, some of the best tap dancers on the planet unite from two coasts to bring you this unique evening of infectious music and cutting-"
