        "@value": "92nd Street Y   Educational Artists in Residence   Dorrance Dance is thrilled to be 92Y’s educational Artist in Residence for the 2020/2021 season. We're so grateful to have the incredible platform of the 92Y to share tap dance with tens of thousands of students and educators across the country."
